WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
This jade pendant contains the blood of gods

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Most likely it is the blood of the goddess of life

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:14,120
You are definitely the blood of the goddess of life.

4
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:21,830
There is no way for Kaka to pour into you

5
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:24,020
Don’t you need to ask for my opinion?

6
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:26,890
Help me finish this job

7
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:28,890
I won’t let Sanitation hit you in the future.

8
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:30,890
if behave well

9
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:32,890
It’s not normal to let you go

10
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:36,070
What should I do if you lie to me?

11
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:37,300
What are you lying to?

12
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,300
Go out and ask around

13
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:46,210
I, Chen Haoyu, when does it matter what time you say it?

14
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:47,210
Let me believe you for once

15
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:48,210
Chen Haoyu

16
00:00:48,210 --> 00:00:50,210
Let me out, I
